@neurodesk/brainchomp incorporates the pinned CPU WebAssembly module from
neuroneural/brainchomp-lib (commit 95c8b9bd186f0fcffabb797e1fe770c26659750e, MIT License)
for rodent MRI brain extraction, matching the Brainchomp web application
(neuroneural/brainchomp commit 51a90203f497cea6b3cf01e34bd113f8c2a6292c).

Third-party components embedded in brainchomp.wasm:

1. MeshNet inference engine
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024-2026 spikedoanz, Sergey Plis.

2. NIfTI I/O (nifti_io.c / nifti_io.h)
   Public-domain NIfTI I/O consolidation based on work by Robert W. Cox,
   Mark Jenkinson, Rick Reynolds, and Chris Rorden.

3. Niivue robust intensity scaling algorithm (conform.c)
   Reimplemented from Niivue (BSD-2-Clause, https://github.com/niivue/niivue)
   and FastSurfer conform.py (Apache-2.0).

4. WGSL convolution structure (TensorFlow.js)
   Copyright 2023 Google LLC, Apache License 2.0.
